                <divLine xml:id="m-ace7fb2a-f575-4a0f-a9a8-1261a9653b12" facs="#m-a8a1ed1b-b24c-4651-a74b-4fd1b1533e98" form="finalis" />
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-6db20c9c-be37-4a6c-9d5b-76e02c1bd447">
              <lg xml:id="m-e518cf20-08b5-484f-accd-ef21e49dd454">
                <l xml:id="m-ef070471-1b1b-47b0-91b3-9a545359d2ad" facs="#m-3d1311e8-8af9-409c-9cc8-4af60c27c97a" label="ambiguous">428</l><l xml:id="m-b36f1aee-d27d-4a9d-a714-ba3264257a5b" facs="#m-1306acc5-79d9-4a86-b263-6ebccf9b4803" label="text-like">The Holy Innocents.</l><l xml:id="m-d3a98f3b-8778-438f-b6a2-c6651637b9d7" facs="#m-ec917a63-c74e-4741-9ed1-415ad582c037" label="lyrics-like">Gló-ri- a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-58548010-ebd5-4637-be70-223c4d320fd1" facs="#m-cbb56e55-07f5-46db-9fdf-0380e87eb06c" label="lyrics-like">men tú-um in uni-vérsa térra!</l><l xml:id="m-f33b3a55-d621-4b7a-8f52-7fb1b52d1330" facs="#m-c45e3040-1aa8-4dbb-889d-951c6c8f0cae" label="ambiguous">E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-7911cbd7-1c11-44dd-8a7c-0f39a5074589" facs="#m-8ffc7431-a5b2-4ff0-abd2-5a4e271186e7" label="lyrics-like">Glória in excélsis. is not said, nor the Allelúia. nor Ite missa est. unless thi¬</l><l xml:id="m-e7a26795-c439-4b7b-8b4c-d3abeb3f2ab6" facs="#m-1963aa35-d3f9-47c2-a952-736b7ce6ccdc" label="text-like">Feast falls on a Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-cdaa7071-9ccf-4fc9-b24f-7f54252a9b6c" facs="#m-3edd8c3b-86a0-4de5-88e4-b9ec24707fb3" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-f35b7b75-8f54-4cd5-9271-3622d894fc95" facs="#m-60b1b4ad-cca9-4a08-843a-a44bdbc6d0aa" label="lyrics-like">Eus, cujus hodiérna die prae¬ rum mala mortífica, ut fidem tuam,</l><l xml:id="m-ea90eb56-dc32-47f6-8537-a7d4526b30e6" facs="#m-933a8d27-0040-486f-afec-a608693c08ea" label="lyrics-like">O cónium Innocéntes Mártyres quam lingua nostra ióquitur. "étiam</l><l xml:id="m-e85c1714-21ce-46ed-aedc-ac65dbbfcb23" facs="#m-4bacde1f-5327-4130-87cd-1f94725df392" label="lyrics-like">non loquéndo, sed moriéndo con-] móribus vita fateátur. Per Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-1d01f7ad-8c4f-4719-a98e-b9b0baca4b36" facs="#m-84a85d69-6b37-4aa8-8c58-790452d8985e" label="lyrics-like">féssi sunt : t ómnia in nobis vitió-Inum.</l><l xml:id="m-da5a484a-c3b8-4f58-beb8-e690834cbeac" facs="#m-906bebce-4bfd-4b3d-b1a9-eee3ad41db54" label="lyrics-like">Commemoration of the Nativity. Collect. Concéde. p. 408.</l><l xml:id="m-5b5ff944-96e1-411a-85bc-ddb31cd2b22f" facs="#m-2dc50783-9906-4063-90d3-aff48039b2f3" label="ambiguous">Lectio libri Apocalypsis beati Joannis Apostoli. Apoc. 14.</l><l xml:id="m-94b25f28-937f-42b7-82cb-42d7817edc86" facs="#m-4169f47f-fb14-4284-bcb5-7b35de8b667e" label="lyrics-like">TN diébus illis: Vidi supra montem! animália, et senióres: et nemo pót¬</l><l xml:id="m-ba2adef5-8ce2-4f02-8e62-05e395165cec" facs="#m-c4b6227c-e392-45da-8e54-e1d35d6f7588" label="ambiguous">1 Sion Agnum stantem, et cum eo</l><l xml:id="m-975094e8-06be-466a-86f4-4f5a525e54ba" facs="#m-c0e42afa-3e48-4219-a867-6989d6b59719" label="lyrics-like">erat dícere cánticum, nisi illa cen¬</l><l xml:id="m-b71f1984-068e-48c0-a38c-46d185ccc2dc" facs="#m-b65c7651-c057-4520-b26f-a0e5e77aa283" label="lyrics-like">tum quadragínta quátuor millia,</l><l xml:id="m-f61405ad-c89b-4913-a7b4-ff7fece3a81d" facs="#m-999f78ef-0004-4c18-b7c8-b951f9326a92" label="lyrics-like">centum quadraginta quátuor millia,</l><l xml:id="m-175788ec-6df9-440f-b038-6f2be26ecb02" facs="#m-4f3c1f7c-297a-41b7-8e96-9e3498ffa743" label="lyrics-like">habéntes nomen ejus, et nomen Pa¬</l><l xml:id="m-de325dc6-13fb-434a-830d-29207ac3df9f" facs="#m-4387ae41-600b-437d-88d4-2ee259c8cfa5" label="ambiguous">qui empti sunt de terra. Hi sunt, qui</l><l xml:id="m-36d293d2-84e2-4c4b-a221-0cbfc1ac9262" facs="#m-46c68d2d-14ae-4fe3-a317-ab267cd69e2a" label="lyrics-like">tris ejus scriptum in fróntibus suis.</l><l xml:id="m-a981929f-73da-498b-a800-339fcdafc284" facs="#m-1818cffd-98b3-453e-b958-7111e7e8ebb1" label="lyrics-like">cum muliéribus non sunt coinqui¬</l><l xml:id="m-52cfb76e-7bed-4527-92c4-160b113a5243" facs="#m-311c461a-cf04-4185-838a-6466c9715455" label="ambiguous">Et audivi vocem de caelo, tamquam</l><l xml:id="m-cbbe4941-b13a-4602-a056-bb817043ef0c" facs="#m-f6da6690-92c1-4aca-9462-799af2da0d68" label="lyrics-like">náti : vírgines enim sunt. Hi sequún¬</l><l xml:id="m-f3d23d61-3a8b-4e80-a21b-218b404d2821" facs="#m-2f236eb3-6488-4cce-a5f3-01ab0574e9ab" label="lyrics-like">vocem aquárum multárum, et tam¬</l><l xml:id="m-205a26df-9d17-40e9-8f86-64b29413d2cf" facs="#m-a5100f17-a884-4852-b6bc-c88e5f67a02d" label="lyrics-like">tur Agnum, quocúmque ferit. Hi</l><l xml:id="m-82d33e10-edd0-4519-a766-7ad83f2be752" facs="#m-44e69f4e-ccca-462d-ac4b-f6c7c653e6ea" label="lyrics-like">quam vocem tonítrui magni: et</l><l xml:id="m-c5d4c552-92da-4a60-874c-ec177a0a9869" facs="#m-5c6ff125-b9aa-4665-89ed-ae52bca74354" label="ambiguous">empti sunt ex hominibus primitiae</l><l xml:id="m-79d2dd98-ddf0-49a2-93fa-7c17f8f46fcc" facs="#m-eb8fc7d0-bae7-4f42-b937-3dcbb047026b" label="lyrics-like">Deo, et Agno: et in ore eórum non</l><l xml:id="m-6292f0f5-73ea-4e7a-b0f8-1abfd7fd731f" facs="#m-8a1d9ac2-2a50-4d48-a896-d4c0bea654cf" label="lyrics-like">vocem, quam audívi, sicut citharoe¬</l><l xml:id="m-0de66814-a4ad-4390-a33e-409a6225e7fe" facs="#m-9fc962c0-f3b2-462f-ae0b-b239639fae67" label="lyrics-like">dórum citharizántium in citharis</l><l xml:id="m-f3af8676-1a07-4423-9a39-ed3b0bcc2799" facs="#m-84ba26dc-246e-4548-b1f9-de4663ede205" label="lyrics-like">est invéntum mendácium: sine má¬</l><l xml:id="m-14b4236d-790d-4636-8515-d593385f0865" facs="#m-400df724-8283-4dbb-92f0-ff9cdf3ea562" label="lyrics-like">suis. Et cantábant quasi cánticum</l><l xml:id="m-e066f71e-7836-449b-a7ed-587a7f424c2d" facs="#m-73bf85fd-cc7f-4207-9c6e-13a04fe5a64e" label="ambiguous">cula enim sunt ante thronum Dei.</l><l xml:id="m-778f8951-be07-47bf-8a32-9efbe0e43ece" facs="#m-cfed44b4-0582-46ba-a720-0b8e6831cfe0" label="lyrics-like">novum ante sedem, et ante quátuor</l><l xml:id="m-b70e237a-ac4e-445e-8106-887b79fc6fa6" facs="#m-94de051e-82cd-467e-99c6-b2214c438103" label="lyrics-like">Gradual. Anima nóstra. from the Common of Many Martyrs, p. 1167.</l><l xml:id="m-cb922e4e-80f9-4a1a-920a-1b3b2f577038" facs="#m-86da7f56-5794-472b-86dc-db292b1b0c5a" label="ambiguous">4.</l><l xml:id="m-733166d1-dd87-42ae-b786-e933989f7eb9" facs="#m-21125cb0-6fc8-4a52-9352-b55ca522fd28" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-8c21e782-85b2-4bed-9290-888436f3d9f3" facs="#m-24083abf-89ba-46f1-a35b-bbd4cee56646" label="lyrics-like">V. Laudá¬</l><l xml:id="m-37cc392f-08f0-431a-bb64-f10463dc1ca7" facs="#m-cea5f05b-b8ff-4728-ae6f-d97bea93ecae" label="lyrics-like">L- le-lú¬ ia.</l><l xml:id="m-2bc889f3-61f0-4f1d-98ba-4c791112256e" facs="#m-4128f2c2-2176-43ee-bff1-c7ea5f4f82be" label="ambiguous">-ij.</l><l xml:id="m-6e18c01c-7a7f-4548-8736-199b4dcf26af" facs="#m-06489a75-b62a-48c0-a325-01ee82172763" label="lyrics-like">laudá¬</l><l xml:id="m-f116afd1-92a9-4603-a56f-e21cd0fd6b3f" facs="#m-73836d1e-7856-4ca5-ba17-84ce22df6560" label="lyrics-like">pú- e-ri Dóminum,</l><l xml:id="m-6cda2784-ad85-43bd-9cf1-9af13f7ed36a" facs="#m-8a81a838-f702-4ce4-a95b-c26dbff03dee" label="ambiguous">te</l><l xml:id="m-3b466a6d-a3da-40df-a1ba-3a85abb2a7a5" facs="#m-69724235-6ee0-4c01-b548-49651c9661c7" label="ambiguous">te</l><l xml:id="m-70774c32-2658-4db8-8cf3-1910438244fd" facs="#m-f9e50ad6-6d7b-47f6-9999-4626b768ef91" label="lyrics-like">nómen“Dómi- ni.</l><l xml:id="m-66a8ef41-4c12-4b05-ad8b-bb61c5a40447" facs="#m-c76f224e-4f20-4aa5-a501-1735c724f355" label="text-like">The following Tract is said instead of the Alleluia. and its Verse, unles¬</l><l xml:id="m-d9131824-dd1e-4e71-ae9f-39b633ed047b" facs="#m-8e901f93-2c3d-4cab-b08f-154d7b8a8ac8" label="text-like">this feast falls on a Sundar: but it is never said on the Octave day.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>